        "brief": "You're on an authorised exercise at Tarrowby Logistics, a fictional firm. A pack is due by Monday and the share is slow. Found sticks and 'quicker way' messages are waiting: some are safe, some aren't. Match each shortcut to the approved way, then sort the messages. Reporting or checking when you're unsure is always fine and never marked down.",
